WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:15.432
"I have to get to Metro City Central Bank," thought Roxy.

2
00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:19.276
"Somebody is robbing it!"

3
00:00:19.276 --> 00:00:22.429
She ran over to Mr. Green.

4
00:00:22.429 --> 00:00:24.778
"Mr. Green," said Roxy.

5
00:00:24.778 --> 00:00:26.992
"I just remembered something.

6
00:00:26.992 --> 00:00:31.298
Principal Penn wanted to, um, talk to me."

7
00:00:31.298 --> 00:00:36.476
"Go ahead, Roxy," said Mr. Green.

8
00:00:36.476 --> 00:00:39.762
A moment later Roxy shot through the air.

9
00:00:39.763 --> 00:00:44.808
"Look!" cried Mara. "Rocket Girl!"

10
00:00:44.808 --> 00:00:46.339
Terrell scratched his head.

11
00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:49.781
"Where did Roxy go?"

12
00:00:49.782 --> 00:00:53.014
Roxy arrived at Metro City Central Bank.

13
00:00:53.014 --> 00:00:56.298
Police cars surrounded the building.

14
00:00:56.299 --> 00:00:58.688
The bank's front doors were smashed.

15
00:00:58.688 --> 00:01:00.992
Smoke poured out of them.

16
00:01:00.992 --> 00:01:06.046
A crowd of people stood across the street.

17
00:01:06.046 --> 00:01:09.272
"Rocket Girl!" called Detective Smith.

18
00:01:09.272 --> 00:01:12.481
Roxy flew over to the detective.

19
00:01:12.481 --> 00:01:17.439
"Are you trying to deposit a check, Detective?" Roxy grinned.

20
00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:18.893
Detective Smith frowned.

21
00:01:18.893 --> 00:01:21.692
"This isn't funny, Rocket Girl.

22
00:01:21.693 --> 00:01:24.876
A robbery is taking place!"

23
00:01:24.877 --> 00:01:27.377
"I know," said Roxy.

24
00:01:27.377 --> 00:01:31.050
"Is the bank robber still in the bank?"

25
00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:34.459
Detective Smith nodded. "I think so."

26
00:01:34.459 --> 00:01:38.271
"Do you know who he is?" asked Roxy.

27
00:01:38.271 --> 00:01:40.899
A woman in the crowd stepped forward.

28
00:01:40.899 --> 00:01:44.938
"Do you mean 'what' he is?"

29
00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:47.580
Roxy was confused.

30
00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.384
"I saw the robber," said the woman.

31
00:01:50.384 --> 00:01:54.097
"He looks like a giant machine!"

32
00:01:54.097 --> 00:01:57.245
"It's true," said a man in a suit.

33
00:01:57.246 --> 00:01:59.479
"He's covered in big, heavy armor.

34
00:01:59.479 --> 00:02:02.175
He looks like an army tank!"

35
00:02:02.175 --> 00:02:05.284
"Hmm," said Detective Smith.

36
00:02:05.284 --> 00:02:10.713
"This must be connected to the crime at Metro City army base."

37
00:02:10.713 --> 00:02:14.355
"What happened at the army base?" asked Roxy.

38
00:02:14.355 --> 00:02:17.456
"Somebody stole a tank," said the detective.

39
00:02:17.456 --> 00:02:20.476
"It happened a couple of nights ago."

40
00:02:20.476 --> 00:02:24.927
"I'm coming out!" shouted a deep voice from inside the bank.

41
00:02:24.927 --> 00:02:28.918
"Everybody better stay out of my way!"

42
00:02:28.918 --> 00:02:31.597
Detective Smith picked up a megaphone.

43
00:02:31.597 --> 00:02:33.569
"The bank is surrounded.

44
00:02:33.569 --> 00:02:36.226
Come out with your hands up!"

45
00:02:36.226 --> 00:02:40.496
"Ha-ha!" The deep voice laughed.

46
00:02:40.496 --> 00:02:46.488
"My name is Hank Tank, and I'm the toughest criminal in Metro City.

47
00:02:46.488 --> 00:02:49.207
Nobody can stop me.

48
00:02:49.207 --> 00:02:54.357
I'm coming out now with all the money I stole."

49
00:02:54.357 --> 00:02:59.974
Roxy heard heavy footsteps inside the bank.

50
00:02:59.974 --> 00:03:05.471
Stomp, stomp, stomp! The building and street shook.

51
00:03:05.471 --> 00:03:09.067
People ran in all different directions.

52
00:03:09.067 --> 00:03:13.290
"The robber is coming out!" shouted a woman.

53
00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:16.702
"Run for your lives!" cried a man.

54
00:03:16.701 --> 00:03:18.972
Detective Smith gulped.

55
00:03:18.973 --> 00:03:22.487
"Hank Tank sounds pretty big."

56
00:03:22.487 --> 00:03:25.465
"Yeah." Roxy nodded.

57
00:03:25.465 --> 00:03:27.529
The footsteps stopped.

58
00:03:27.529 --> 00:03:31.334
For a moment everything was quiet.

59
00:03:31.334 --> 00:03:37.948
Then—ka-boom!
